      "text": {
        "en": "Many customers express appreciation for stylists like Evelyn, Andrea, and Felicia for their gentle bedside manner and attentive handling of dogs. However, several reviewers voiced frustration over customer service disputes, unexpected post-service charges, and unreturned managerial calls."
      }
