      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents often highlight the loving attention their dogs receive, noting that pets leave relaxed and excited to return for bakery treats. While most dogs appear pampered and content, two owners reported distress and lethargy following overly close shaving and clipper burns."
      }
    },
