        "en": "Clients frequently praise clean styling, fresh scented baths, and meticulous nail grinding on small and medium dog breeds. Nevertheless, dissatisfied customers cite instances where groomers shaved coats excessively short, mismatched reference photos, or caused clipper irritation."
